V'EH EDDYR MARROO NY CHADLEY CHA DUG MEE

618
00:37:37,920 --> 00:37:40,980
GRA CRE JEU ER YN OYR DY ROW

619
00:37:40,980 --> 00:37:45,389
NY SOOILLYN FOSHLIT AS MUC CLAGHAN AGH GYN

620
00:37:45,389 --> 00:37:47,639
CASLYS GLESSAGH Y VEA SHIONE DOU

621
00:37:48,659 --> 00:37:51,330
AS EC NY LHIEGGANYN VA OOILLEY YN CHASHTAL

622
00:37:51,360 --> 00:37:53,400
VILLISH TROOID OOILLEY YN VEAYNID OC

623
00:37:54,510 --> 00:37:56,550
VA NY MEILLYN COOID JOARREE DYS VAD RIEAU

624
00:37:58,260 --> 00:38:01,410
AGH CHA ROW MONNEY DY LHEILTYS GYN GROAN

625
00:38:01,409 --> 00:38:05,039
FOALLEY GYN ENNAL GYN BUILLEY Y CHREE

626
00:38:06,750 --> 00:38:10,139
CHROYM MEE HARRISH AS HUG MEE EAB RYGHEDDYN

627
00:38:10,139 --> 00:38:11,250
MONNEY DY VIOYS

628
00:38:12,510 --> 00:38:13,619
AGH AYNS FARDAIL

629
00:38:15,690 --> 00:38:17,909
TAN EARISH FODDEY VE ER NY LHIE AYNS

630
00:38:17,909 --> 00:38:19,920
SHEN ER MYR DY BEAGH YN SORCH TA

631
00:38:19,920 --> 00:38:22,920
BEOYNAGH ER LHEIE ERSOOYL AYNS KUSE DY OOR

632
00:38:24,300 --> 00:38:28,769
GOLLRISH CEAU Y CHISHTEY VA'N FOCKLE BRODDIT LESH

633
00:38:28,769 --> 00:38:30,420
COOYL AYNS SHOH AS AYNS SHEN

634
00:38:31,889 --> 00:38:35,280
SMOOINEE MEE FODDEE DY ROW NY OGHERYN ECHEY

635
00:38:36,119 --> 00:38:40,110
AGH TRA HIE MEE DY RONSAGHEY HONNICK MEE

636
00:38:40,409 --> 00:38:44,699
NY SOOILLYN MARROO AS AYRN DOU MARROO MY

637
00:38:44,699 --> 00:38:48,059
VAD LHEID DY CHEILLEY DY GHOOIE

638
00:38:49,079 --> 00:38:51,809
GA NAGH ROW ENNYM ECHEY ORRYM DY ROW

639
00:38:51,809 --> 00:38:55,440
MEE AYN REN MEE CHEA VEIH YN YNNYD

640
00:39:01,949 --> 00:39:04,319
HEER ELLEY JEH CHYNDAA SY GHAELG JEH DROGH

641
00:39:04,320 --> 00:39:07,440
LIOAR LIORISH BRIM STHOLKEY RY CHLASHTYN AYNS CLAARE

642
00:39:07,440 --> 00:39:09,239
NY GAEL FASTYR BEG JEDOONEE

643
00:39:10,380 --> 00:39:12,539
SHEN EH REESHT AS VEES OLLISH ABBYR SHEN

644
00:39:12,539 --> 00:39:13,889
REESHT STARNO

645
00:39:20,099 --> 00:39:24,450
LESSON IS KILLING AS BLEIN VIE NOA OOILLEY

646
00:39:24,960 --> 00:39:28,589
AS LHIASSVOIR NAILS INTO YNLHOAMEY VEAGH AMAZING

647
00:39:29,969 --> 00:39:32,910
LHIAMLHIAT CHENGEY FODDEE TA LHIATTEE IN MANX

648
00:39:34,469 --> 00:39:36,750
IS GEDDYN HEOSE ER DTY HIE PILATE

649
00:39:38,940 --> 00:39:39,539
VEL SHOH

650
00:39:41,159 --> 00:39:44,610
OSTYLLYS INVADERS LAA JEH'N PHOSSAN SHOH

651
00:39:48,420 --> 00:39:49,320
EANISHYN DY VIE

